    "description": "The Utility Billing Reminders API provides businesses with the ability to access a list of upcoming utility billing reminders. This endpoint is designed for systems that require access to reminder notifications for billing cycles to enhance customer service and billing accuracy. Typical consumers include billing systems, customer relationship management platforms, and customer service applications. By utilizing this API, organizations can ensure proactive communication with customers regarding their utility payments, thereby improving payment timeliness and customer satisfaction.",
